.TH focusforge-cli-history-list 1  "list 0.1.0-rc.4" 
.SH NAME
focusforge\-cli\-history\-list \- List every visible checkpoint, newest first
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfocusforge\-cli history list\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-accept\-changed\-sources\fR] [\fB\-v \fR]... [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPROJECT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List every visible checkpoint, newest first
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit the JSON document instead of human\-readable text
.TP
\fB\-\-accept\-changed\-sources\fR
Accept changed source frames, printing their warning instead of refusing
.TP
\fB\-v\fR
Increase log detail (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Log errors only
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPROJECT\fR>
The project to list
.SH VERSION
v0.1.0\-rc.4
